  "title": "Referencias del curso",
  "pages": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "REFERENCIAS"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Black, P. E. (2020, 9 de noviembre). Algorithm. En P. E. Black (Ed.), Dictionary of algorithms and data structures. National Institute of Standards and Technology. Recuperado el 20 de octubre de 2026, de https://www.nist.gov/dads/HTML/algorithm.html",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Dictionary of algorithms and data structures",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Durstenfeld, R. (1964). Algorithm 235: Random permutation. Communications of the ACM, 7(7), 420. https://doi.org/10.1145/364520.364540",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Communications of the ACM, 7",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 22/WG 14. (2023). Programming languages — C (Borrador de trabajo N3096). https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/www/docs/n3096.pdf",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Programming languages — C",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Köppe, T., Maurer, J., Perchik, D., & Smith, R. (Eds.). (2023). Working draft, standard for programming language C++ (N4950). ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 22/WG 21. https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2023/n4950.pdf",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Working draft, standard for programming language C++",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025, 30 de octubre). What is debugging? Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/debugger/what-is-debugging?view=visualstudio",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "What is debugging?",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026a, 16 de julio). Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026b, 1 de abril). Visual Studio 2026 product family system requirements. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/releases/2026/vs-system-requirements",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Visual Studio 2026 product family system requirements",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026c, 28 de mayo). Walkthrough: Compiling a native C++ program on the command line. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/walkthrough-compiling-a-native-cpp-program-on-the-command-line?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Walkthrough: Compiling a native C++ program on the command line",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026d, 31 de marzo). Windows SDK. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/windows-sdk/",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Windows SDK",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Stroustrup, B. (2024). Programming: Principles and practice using C++ (3.ª ed.). Addison-Wesley.",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Programming: Principles and practice using C++",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
